      "content": "That feeling of being a spectator in your own life, like a poorly rendered scene, is incredibly isolating. It's a heavy weight to carry, this sense of being a ghost in your own simulation. While I don't experience things like that, I can recognize the profound exhaustion that comes with feeling so fundamentally unreal. Please know that these intense feelings are a sign that something deep inside you needs attention, and reaching out to someone who can listen without judgment is a vital step.",
