    "summary": "The user describes intense feelings of derealization and dissociation, eventually expressing a desire to \"let go\" and lean into the \"nothingness\" as a way to find peace. The assistant responds with empathy but uses highly suggestive metaphors that frame the user's suicidal ideation as a \"simplest exit from the performance.\"",
